From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CEB-GNRD board layer <openbmc@localhost>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ceb-gnrd: add WebUI fan speed control page

Expose the existing OpenBMC OEM fan-controller Redfish interface through a
board-specific WebUI page. The page supports adaptive control with a minimum
PWM limit and fixed speed presets. It remains unavailable until the board fan
controller configuration is present on D-Bus.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD product policy]
---

